.TH GXWI-HELLO-APP 1 2026-10-19 "Peios gxwi 0.0.7"
.SH NAME
gxwi-hello-app \- demonstrate live and custom GXWI application pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gxwi-hello-app
.RB [ --raw ]
.RI [ greeting ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gxwi-hello-app
connects to the display in its environment and opens a demonstration window.
The live window shares a counter and note between browser views.
Greeting arguments replace the default greeting.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --raw
When supplied as the first argument, open the scripted diagnostic page instead of a live surface.
The page probes the compositor's raw-page isolation and resource behavior.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The desktop loop ended after its surfaces or connection closed.
.TP
.B 1
Connecting to or running on the desktop failed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GXWI_DISPLAY
Display socket supplied by the compositor when starting an application.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gxwi-hello (1),
.BR libgxwi (3)
